2. FREE-PRODUCT USE
A "Free Product" is a software product or service offered to every end user without requiring payment to use its TextInspector-powered functionality and without generating revenue from that product or service, directly or indirectly. Free-Product Use is allowed even if the developer or publisher is a company, and includes free public websites, free applications, and free customer-facing services.

A product is NOT a Free Product when it is sold, requires a paid plan or subscription, uses ads or sponsorship to monetize the product, sells access or premium features, charges customers to access its functionality, or uses the product to deliver paid client work or a paid commercial service. Merely being developed by a for-profit company does not disqualify an otherwise genuinely free, non-monetized product.

Internal business systems and software used to provide paid services or generate business revenue are not Free Products, even where end users do not pay to access the software directly. Commercial use of this kind requires Pro.

3. PRO UPGRADE
If the product becomes monetized, paid, or otherwise falls outside Free-Product Use, obtain a valid TextInspector Pro commercial license and replace the Lite packages with the Pro packages before that use begins. Owning Pro does not authorize continuing to deploy Lite contrary to this license.

